+## 3. Cross-Signal Synthesis
+
+The four lanes compose into one marketplace-readiness story: R13 gives per-call
+monetization, R14 makes the cost ledger trustworthy and joinable, R16 makes third-party
+plugin execution survivable, and R15 marks the future lane without letting it distract
+from MCP work already landing (P-02). Sequence that respects dependencies:
+R16/R14 first (safety + observability), R13 second (monetize what is now safe and
+metered), R15 last (RFC-only, gated on P-05).
